#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "Like any other project of F-Droid, Repomaker is free and open source software. You can find the source code and its license on [gitlab.com](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker)."
msgstr "Como calquera outro proxecto do F-Droid, o Repomaker é un software libre e de código aberto. Pode encontrar o código fonte e a sua licenza en[GitLab.com](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker)."

#~ msgid "If you want to contribute financially, we recommend using a **free (as in free software) donation platform** like **[Liberapay](https://liberapay.com/F-Droid-Data/)** or **[Open Collective](https://opencollective.com/f-droid/)**. **Liberapay** has lower fees but **Open Collective** allows more flexibility and transparency on how the funds are used.  Both platforms allow for recurrent donations which are highly desirable for making F-Droid sustainable."
#~ msgstr "Se quixer contribuír financeiramente, recomendamos o uso dunha plataforma de doazóns **libre (como en software libre)** como **[Liberapay](https://liberapay.com/F-Droid-Data/)** ou **[Open Collective](https://opencollective.com/f-droid/)**. **Liberapay** ten taxas máis baixas, mais **Open Collective** permite máis flexibilidade e transparencia na forma como os fondos son utilizados.  Ambas as plataformas permiten doazóns recorrentes que son altamente desexábeis para tornar o F-Droid en sustentábel."

